<http://data.silknow.org/object/08e514d7-8fb0-3c32-ac27-f101adfd0448/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "\"Jouy print\".  Copper plate engraving in red.  The ground is covered with a scale pattern of diamonds.  On (a),  are Vulcan forging armor and Juno in a chariot drawn by peacocks.  On one border are the signs of the Zodiac,  on the other eagles,  lizards,  fishnets,  musical instruments,  rakes,  etc.  On (b),  are Venus in a shell drawn by dolphins and Jupiter with a cornucopia.  Pieced."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/08e514d7-8fb0-3c32-ac27-f101adfd0448> .

